'''Highpass Hold''' (sometimes incorrectly referred to as '''Highhold Pass''') is a mountain pass on a route from Qeynos to Freeport, guarded by the valiant guards of [[High Keep]]. Orcs and gnolls have patrols that run up to the foot of the Keep itself, and the brave Highpass citizens have carved out their homes out of the gulleys and nooks. 

